WEBVTT

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:02.440
What happens during a major corporate

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.780
merger? Oh, wow.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.760
When two massive global companies combine,

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.780
is the future of M &A

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.460
less about merging finances and entirely

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.159
about whether their respective AI ontologies

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.460
can successfully negotiate a shared

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.040
reality? If company A's ontology defines

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.060
risk or revenue in a way

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.540
that fundamentally clashes with company

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.880
B's ontology at a mathematical level,

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.619
can the merger ever truly succeed

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:30.640
without completely rewriting the central

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.759
nervous system of one of the

00:00:31.759 --> 00:00:32.099
companies?
